Leather goods business

Tech stack:
  Python Flask
  React
  Stripe
  S3 for pictures
  MUI (exception to the AGENTS.md - will not use bootstrap)

Features:
  Admins can create products with a price, pictures, descripiton, and other things. 
  Admins can view orders and update an order to Shipped (with the UPS tracking link), Delivered, etc
  Customers can create an account
  Customers can purchase products using buy now with or without an account
  Customers can Add to their cart with or without an account and buy in bulk
  Emails are sent for various reasons:
    Customer creates an account (email confirmation link)
    Customer verifies their email (welcome email)
    Customer requests a password reset (reset code)
    Customer buys a product
    Admin changes the status to Shipped or Delivered
